return ['domain'=>'presspermit-pro','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'PublishPress Permissions Pro 4.8.1','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-04-02T18:54:49+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01 19:50+0000','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['PublishPress Permissions Pro'=>'PublishPress 权限专业版','https://publishpress.com/permissions'=>'https://publishpress.com/permissions','PublishPress Permissions allows you to enable or deny access to posts, pages, categories, tags and more.'=>'PublishPress 权限允许您启用或拒绝对帖子、页面、类别、标签等的访问。','PublishPress'=>'PublishPress','https://publishpress.com/'=>'https://publishpress.com/','Should pages with privacy status "premium" require set_pages_premium and edit_premium_pages capabilities? If so, you can %1$sassign a status-specific Page Editor role%2$s or %3$sadd the capabilities directly to a role%4$s.'=>'页面的隐私状态为“高级”时，是否需要 set_pages_premium 和 edit_premium_pages 权限？如果是，您可以 %1$s分配一个状态特定的页面编辑角色%2$s 或者 %3$s将权限直接添加到角色中%4$s。','Note: Workflow sequence and branching for pre-publication is configured %son a separate screen%s'=>'注意：预发布的工作流顺序和分支在 %son a separate screen%s 中配置。','Additional settings provided by the %s module.'=>'由 %s 模块提供的附加设置。','Note: If you deactive, re-entry of the license key will be required for re-activation.'=>'注意：如果您停用，则需要重新输入许可证密钥以进行重新激活。','If enabled, custom group membership is applied network-wide (though role assignments are still site-specific).'=>'如果启用，自定义组成员资格将在整个网络中适用（尽管角色分配仍然是特定于站点的）。','Can create network-wide permission groups'=>'可以创建网络范围的权限组','If group editing is allowed, can also modify network group membership'=>'如果允许组编辑，还可以修改网络组成员资格','This feature will control direct URL access to files in /uploads/ folder. By default, files are blocked if they are attached to a post which the user can\'t view.'=>'此功能将控制对 /uploads/ 文件夹中文件的直接 URL 访问。默认情况下，如果文件附加到用户无法查看的帖子，则该文件将被阻止。','File Access on multisite installations will require the following rules to be inserted above the stock ms-files.php rules in the %1$smain .htaccess file%2$s:'=>'在多站点安装中，文件访问将要求在 %1$smain .htaccess 文件%2$s 中的库存 ms-files.php 规则上方插入以下规则：','But your .htaccess is missing or not writeable!'=>'但是您的 .htaccess 文件缺失或不可写！','.htaccess needs to be updated to include these rules.'=>'.htaccess 需要更新以包含这些规则。','.htaccess file has all required rules.'=>'.htaccess 文件具有所有所需的规则。','These rules will not be inserted automatically.  You are responsible for editing .htaccess and later removing the rules if the functionality is no longer desired.'=>'这些规则不会自动插入。您负责编辑 .htaccess，并在不再需要该功能时删除这些规则。','Note that an additional rule will need to be added with each new site. %1$sTo eliminate this requirement, research "WordPress remove ms-files".%2$s'=>'请注意，每个新站点需要添加一个额外的规则。 %1$s要消除此要求，请研究“WordPress remove ms-files”。%2$s','You will need to manually restore the .htacces file to default contents if anything goes wrong. Proceed?'=>'如果出现任何问题，您需要手动恢复 .htaccess 文件为默认内容。继续吗？','Update .htaccess now'=>'立即更新 .htaccess','only for sites with protected files'=>'仅适用于有受保护文件的网站','for all sites'=>'适用于所有网站','NONE: remove Permissions rules'=>'无：移除权限规则','Since the plugin is not network-activated, you will need to modify the .htaccess file manually, inserting a RewriteRule as shown above for each site which needs file filtering.'=>'由于插件未在网络中激活，您需要手动修改 .htaccess 文件，为每个需要文件过滤的网站插入如上所示的 RewriteRule。','This extends the File Access feature to files that are not attached to any post. This will not apply to user who have the edit_private_files or pp_list_all_files capability.'=>'这将文件访问功能扩展到未附加到任何帖子的文件。这不适用于具有 edit_private_files 或 pp_list_all_files 权限的用户。','Make attached files unreadable to users who do not have the edit_private_files or pp_list_all_files capability.'=>'使附加文件对没有 edit_private_files 或 pp_list_all_files 权限的用户不可读。','Improve Media Library performance by disabling file filtering for thumbnails (size specified in Settings > Media).'=>'通过禁用缩略图的文件过滤（在设置 > 媒体中指定大小）来提高媒体库性能。','On some sites, an additional redirect is required to correctly deliver protected files. Leave this disabled for better performance if possible.'=>'在某些网站上，需要额外的重定向以正确交付受保护的文件。如果可能，请保持此功能禁用以获得更好的性能。','The File Access feature uses an %1$s.htaccess%2$s file located at %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s. Normally no action is needed, but clicking the button below will update the URL keys (at next site access) that protect the files.'=>'文件访问功能使用位于 %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s 的 %1$s.htaccess%2$s 文件。通常不需要任何操作，但单击下面的按钮将更新保护文件的 URL 密钥（在下一个网站访问时）。','The File Access feature uses an %1$s.htaccess%2$s file located at %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s. Normally no action is needed, but clicking the button below will update the URL keys that protect the files.'=>'文件访问功能使用位于 %3$suploads/.htaccess%4$s 的 %1$s.htaccess%2$s 文件。通常不需要任何操作，但单击下面的按钮将更新保护文件的 URL 密钥。','Best practice is to access the above url periodically (using your own cron service) to prevent long-term bookmarking of protected files.'=>'最佳实践是定期访问上述 URL（使用您自己的 cron 服务），以防止长期书签化受保护的文件。','Supply a custom key which will enable a support url to regenerate file access keys.  Then execute the url regularly (using your own cron service) to prevent long-term bookmarking of protected files.'=>'提供一个自定义密钥，这将启用支持 URL 重新生成文件访问密钥。然后定期执行该 URL（使用您自己的 cron 服务），以防止长期书签化受保护的文件。','File Access can also protect files uploaded by FTP or other manual file copy, but does not detect them automatically. Click the button below to scan your uploads folder for files to protect.'=>'文件访问还可以保护通过 FTP 或其他手动文件复制上传的文件，但不会自动检测它们。单击下面的按钮扫描您的上传文件夹以寻找要保护的文件。','Invalid file filtering key argument.'=>'无效的文件过滤密钥参数。','Please configure File Access options!'=>'请配置文件访问选项！','The wp-content folder cannot be relocated outside the main WordPress folder.'=>'wp-content 文件夹无法移到 WordPress 主文件夹之外。','Files linked in post content must be in %1$s (or a subfolder of it). If you move files, consider using a %2$s search and replace plugin%3$s to update those URLs.'=>'在帖子内容中链接的文件必须在 %1$s（或其子文件夹中）。如果您移动文件，请考虑使用 %2$s 搜索和替换插件%3$s 来更新这些 URL。','File Access can also protect files uploaded by FTP or other manual processes, but does not detect them automatically. This utility can find and protect any uploaded files.'=>'文件访问还可以保护通过 FTP 或其他手动过程上传的文件，但不会自动检测它们。此工具可以找到并保护任何上传的文件。','To run this utility by cron task or other direct request, use the following URL:'=>'要通过 cron 任务或其他直接请求运行此工具，请使用以下 URL：','To run this utility by direct URL, set a file filtering regen key on Permissions Settings'=>'要通过直接 URL 运行此实用程序，请在权限设置中设置文件过滤再生密钥','Note: Direct access to uploaded file attachments cannot be filtered because your WP_CONTENT_DIR is not in the WordPress branch.'=>'注意：无法过滤对上传文件附件的直接访问，因为您的 WP_CONTENT_DIR 不在 WordPress 分支中。','The operation was terminated due to an invalid configuration.'=>'由于配置无效，操作已终止。','Checking %s posts / pages...'=>'正在检查 %s 个帖子 / 页面...','%1$s skipping unfilterable file in %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s 在 %2$s "%3$s" 中跳过不可过滤的文件：%4$s %5$s','%1$s skipping missing file in %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s 在 %2$s "%3$s" 中跳过缺失的文件：%4$s %5$s','%1$sNew attachment in %2$s "%3$s":%4$s %5$s'=>'%1$s 在 %2$s "%3$s" 中新增附件：%4$s %5$s','%s linked uploads were found in your post / page content.'=>'在您的帖子 / 页面内容中找到 %s 个链接上传。','%s attachment records were added to the database.'=>'已将 %s 个附件记录添加到数据库中。','All linked uploads are already registered as attachments.'=>'所有链接的上传文件已作为附件注册。','Statuses enabled here are available as Visibility options for post publishing. Affected posts become inaccessable without a corresponding status-specific role assignment.'=>'此处启用的状态可作为发布帖子的可见性选项。受影响的帖子在没有相应的状态特定角色分配的情况下将无法访问。','Statuses enabled here are available in the editor as additional steps between Draft and Published.'=>'此处启用的状态在编辑器中作为草稿和已发布之间的额外步骤可用。','Statuses alter your content\'s accessibility by imposing additional capability requirements.'=>'状态通过施加额外的能力要求来改变您内容的可访问性。','Enable Custom Capabilities by toggling the link below status name. If enabled, non-Editors will need a corresponding %ssupplemental role%s to edit posts of that status.'=>'通过切换状态名称下方的链接启用自定义能力。如果启用，非编辑人员将需要相应的 %ssupplemental role%s 来编辑该状态的帖子。','For post edit by a user who cannot publish, %sworkflow is configured%s to make the Publish button increment the post to the next workflow status permitted.'=>'对于无法发布的用户编辑帖子，%sworkflow is configured%s 使发布按钮将帖子增量到下一个允许的工作流程状态。','For post edit by a user who cannot publish, %sworkflow is configured%s to make the Publish button escalate the post to the highest-ordered workflow status permitted.'=>'对于无法发布的用户编辑帖子，%sworkflow is configured%s 使发布按钮将帖子提升到允许的最高顺序工作流程状态。','For post edit by a user who cannot publish, the Publish button will escalate the post to the highest-order status permitted to the user.'=>'对于无法发布的用户编辑帖子，发布按钮将把帖子提升到用户允许的最高顺序状态。','Please enable the PublishPress %sStatuses feature%s.'=>'请启用 PublishPress %sStatuses feature%s。','Note that the Post Type itself will also need to have %sPermissions%s enabled.'=>'请注意，帖子类型本身也需要启用 %sPermissions%s。','To disable custom visibility statuses, first re-assign posts to a different status.'=>'要禁用自定义可见性状态，请先将帖子重新分配到其他状态。','Note, this only applies if the role definition includes the pp_moderate_any capability'=>'注意，这仅适用于角色定义包含 pp_moderate_any 能力的情况','Create or edit custom Privacy or Workflow statuses.'=>'创建或编辑自定义隐私或工作流状态。','Create or edit custom Privacy statuses.'=>'创建或编辑自定义隐私状态。','Extra Roles created as a type-specific copy of this role will enable assignment of specified custom statuses.'=>'作为此角色的特定类型副本创建的额外角色将启用指定自定义状态的分配。','Editors do not need status-specific editing capabilities for workflow posts (Assigned, In Progress, Approved).'=>'编辑者不需要针对工作流帖子（已分配、进行中、已批准）的状态特定编辑能力。','If enabled, non-Editors will need to be granted editing access via the "Permissions" screen.'=>'如果启用，非编辑者需要通过“权限”界面授予编辑访问权限。','If enabled, a Visibility Status dropdown will appear in Quick Edit for easy status assignment.'=>'如果启用，快速编辑中将出现可见性状态下拉菜单，以便于状态分配。','If enabled, this will add Visibility Statuses support to the PublishPress Status plugin.'=>'如果启用，这将为 PublishPress 状态插件添加可见性状态支持。','Post property or meta field to match with user field'=>'帖子属性或元字段与用户字段匹配','User property or meta field to match with post field'=>'用户属性或元字段与帖子字段匹配','User meta field to match with post field'=>'用户元字段与帖子字段匹配','User role to include in synchronization'=>'要包含在同步中的用户角色','Parent id for created posts'=>'创建帖子时的父级 ID','Choose post field from suggested meta key names'=>'从建议的元键名称中选择帖子字段','When a new user of specified role is added, create or designate a post for them.'=>'当添加指定角色的新用户时，创建或指定一个帖子给他们。','Create or designate a post for existing users.'=>'为现有用户创建或指定一个帖子。','This post type is not hierarchical'=>'此帖子类型不是层级的','Automatically create a post for each user in selected roles.'=>'为选定角色中的每个用户自动创建一个帖子。','Hint: If %s have custom fields (like email address), create one to assist field name discovery.'=>'提示：如果 %s 有自定义字段（如电子邮件地址），请创建一个以帮助发现字段名称。','Enable each user to edit their own User Posts.'=>'允许每个用户编辑自己的用户帖子。','Settings for replacing unreadable content with teaser text, provided by the %s module.'=>'用于用 %s 模块提供的预告文本替换不可读内容的设置。','Settings on this tab do not apply because teaser filtering is disabled for all post types.'=>'此选项卡上的设置不适用，因为所有帖子类型的预告过滤已被禁用。','Since some browsers will cache feeds without regard to user login, block RSS content even for qualified users.'=>'由于某些浏览器会缓存提要而不考虑用户登录，即使对于合格用户也会阻止 RSS 内容。','This feature controls what users will see when trying to view content they are blocked from accessing.'=>'此功能控制用户在尝试查看被阻止访问的内容时所看到的内容。','These settings adjust which views, link types and visibility statuses the teaser is applied to.'=>'这些设置调整预告应用于哪些视图、链接类型和可见性状态。','You can override Teaser settings within the Nav Menu by hiding links to unreadable posts that are associated with the terms you select below.'=>'您可以通过隐藏与您在下面选择的术语相关的不可读帖子链接来覆盖导航菜单中的预告设置。','Keep unreadable content hidden in the blogroll and link lists, but show the teaser on direct access attempts.'=>'在博客列表和链接列表中保持不可读内容隐藏，但在直接访问尝试时显示预告。','Hide unreadable private posts, but show a teaser for posts which are unreadable due to regular Privacy or Role Restrictions.'=>'隐藏不可读的私人帖子，但对由于常规隐私或角色限制而不可读的帖子显示预告。','If anyone tries to view a post they don\'t have access to, redirect to another post instead of displaying a teaser.'=>'如果有人尝试查看他们没有访问权限的帖子，则重定向到另一篇帖子，而不是显示预告。','Replace post content or excerpt with custom text, possibly including an inline login form. You can also add text before or after the post title and excerpt.'=>'用自定义文本替换帖子内容或摘录，可能包括内联登录表单。您还可以在帖子标题和摘录之前或之后添加文本。','Unreadable items of these comma-separated types will have nav menu item hidden.'=>'这些逗号分隔类型的不可读项将隐藏导航菜单项。','Visibility Circle membership does not limit viewing access.'=>'可见性圈成员资格不限制查看访问。','Editorial Circle membership does not limit editing access.'=>'编辑圈成员资格不限制编辑访问。','When searching for users via Permissions ajax, return return only users registered to current site'=>'通过权限 ajax 搜索用户时，仅返回注册到当前站点的用户。','If user is a super admin or has \'pp_manage_network_members\' capability, user searches via Permissions ajax return users from all sites'=>'如果用户是超级管理员或具有 \'pp_manage_network_members\' 权限，则通过权限 ajax 搜索用户将返回所有站点的用户。','Count users as a member of a BuddyPress Permissions Group only if they are a moderator of the BP group'=>'仅当用户是 BP 组的版主时，才将用户算作 BuddyPress 权限组的成员。','Count users as a member of a BuddyPress Permissions Group only if they are an administrator of the BP group'=>'仅当用户是 BP 组的管理员时，才将用户算作 BuddyPress 权限组的成员。','CMS Page Tree View plugin: hide \'add\' links (for all hierarchical post types) based on user\'s association permissions'=>'CMS 页面树视图插件：根据用户的关联权限隐藏 “添加” 链接（适用于所有层次帖子类型）。','CMS Page Tree View plugin: hide \'add\' links (for pages) based on user\'s page association permissions'=>'CMS 页面树视图插件：根据用户的页面关联权限隐藏 “添加” 链接（适用于页面）。','CMS Page Tree View plugin: hide \'add\' links (for specified hierarchical post type) based on user\'s association permissions'=>'CMS 页面树视图插件：根据用户的关联权限隐藏 “添加” 链接（适用于指定的层次帖子类型）。','Prevent Permission from filtering the Nested Pages listing at all'=>'阻止权限完全过滤嵌套页面列表','Force Permissions to filter the Nested Pa